  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.99: Zero-edit contract enforced via StaticWebAsset items (SourceType=Package) instead of Content Include+Link. DefineStaticWebAssets only processes Content items, so bypassing it prevents the materialization of SDK runtime files into /home/runner/work/WasmMvcRuntime/WasmMvcRuntime/NetWasmMvc.SDK\\wwwroot\\. Assets are served from the SDK NuGet cache via the StaticWebAssets manifest — consumer source tree stays byte-identical to `dotnet new mvc`.",
